  "messages": {
    "welcome": "**Welcome to VALIOUX** 🖤\nOfficial server of our Fortnite organisation: Pro team, Academy and creators.\n\n✅ Read the rules in #rules\n🎮 Chat with the community in #chat\n🎫 Apply or ask us anything in #open-a-ticket\n🌐 Website, shop and news: [your-domain]\n\n#VLXWIN",
    "rules": "**Server rules**\n1. Be respectful. No racism, sexism, homophobia, bullying or hate speech.\n2. No spam, ads or unsolicited DMs.\n3. No cheats, account trading or illegal content.\n4. No NSFW. Use the right channel for each topic.\n5. Follow moderators. Questions about decisions: open a ticket.\n6. Discord ToS and Fortnite rules apply.\n\nBreaking the rules: warning → timeout → kick → ban.",
